    "A": "Ordinary fabric: brick_backwall panels, top/base strips, floor_top_a-d, sparse torch_wall + torch_glow at varied spacing (roughly every 10-20 columns), an occasional torch_wall_unlit, door_plank or grime_patch_*.",
