    "C": "Special function, sparing: one pipe run (pipe_*), one valve_wheel, one maintenance_box; optional lichen_crust only next to a damp source. Every pipe end terminates in a collar (pipe_v_floor_collar, pipe_v_ceiling_collar, pipe_wall_collar_r) or the maintenance_box; never in mid-air.",
    "corridor_ends": "Close a corridor with wall_face_l/r (alternate *_b for the second quoin phase), ceiling_corner_in_l/r where the ceiling meets it, wall_cap_* on top of low walls and ceiling_corner_out_l/r where a ceiling course ends.",
    "panels": "brick_backwall panel cells must be used in their native order horizontally (cell x+1 follows cell x within a panel, the panel's last column may be followed by column 0 of any panel of the same family). Any vertical order is seamless.",
